    "content": {
      "component": "blog_article",
      "sharepoint_id": "83",
      "title": "\"The Reflective Nurse\": A Journal That Helps Nurses Pause, Process, and Grow",
      "description": "",
      "date": "Jun 27, 2025",
      "read_time": "2 min read",
      "author": "Maxwel Anekea",
      "isGlobal": true,
      "banner_image": {
        "fieldtype": "asset",
        "_local": "83-Banner.jpg"
      },
      "thumbnail": {
        "fieldtype": "asset"
      },
      "languages": [],
      "show_share": true,
      "show_similar": true,
      "similar_show_header": true,
      "category": "",
      "isFeatured": null,
      "body": [
        {
          "component": "rich_text",
          "content": {
            "type": "doc",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "In the busyness of clinical work, nursing students and professionals alike often struggle to pause and make sense of what they're experiencing. That's why "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Reflective Nurse",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "italic"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ", a guided journal by Lilian Karanja, a postgraduate nursing student at the Aga Khan University, is such a timely and meaningful resource."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Lilian, who has worked in both home-based care and the ICU, knows firsthand the emotional toll and complexity of clinical work. Through her practice and teaching, she noticed a gap: a lack of structured tools to support reflection, especially ones created by and for nurses in the African context. Her journal fills that gap."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "What makes "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Reflective Nurse",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "italic"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " stand out is its simplicity and purpose. Built around the well-known Gibbs Reflection Cycle, it offers a range of prompts to help nurses reflect on personal strengths, team dynamics, difficult cases, and emotional responses. The journal encourages users not just to record events but to explore how those experiences shape their mindset and growth."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Some of the prompts came from Lilian's own reflections; others were inspired by conversations with colleagues and patterns she observed in practice. The result is a resource that feels authentic, grounded, and relevant to everyday clinical realities."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "As a current student at AKU's School of Nursing and Midwifery, Lilian's work reflects the university's emphasis on learning, innovation, and impact. Writing the journal while still studying helped her reconnect with her purpose and showed her what's possible when academic work and personal passion align."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "One line from our conversation stood out to me:"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "hard_break"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " \"If it helps even one nurse feel seen and supported, then it was worth doing.\""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "That quote captures the heart of "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Reflective Nurse",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "italic"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". It's not just a place to write; it's a tool for healing, learning, and building a better nursing culture from within."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "As more nurses begin turning to tools that support mental wellbeing and professional development, journals like this can offer a powerful starting point."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Whether you're still in training or deep into practice, "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Reflective Nurse",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "italic"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " invites you to slow down, reflect, and grow, one page at a time."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "The Reflective Nurse is available as an eBook on "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Nuria.com",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
                        "attrs": {
                          "href": "http://nuria.com/",
                          "target": "_self",
                          "linktype": "url",
                          "uuid": null,
                          "anchor": null,
                          "custom": {}
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " and "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Kobo.com",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
                        "attrs": {
                          "href": "http://kobo.com/",
                          "target": "_self",
                          "linktype": "url",
                          "uuid": null,
                          "anchor": null,
                          "custom": {}
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": ". Print copies can be ordered via email at "
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "raywannursesconsultancy@gmail.com",
                    "marks": [
                      {
                        "type": "link",
